Package: mypackage
Type: Package
Title: What the Package Does (One Line, Title Case)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", email = "first.last@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: More about what it does (maybe more than one
    line).
    Use four spaces when indenting paragraphs within the
    Description.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 3.1.0)
Imports: methods, stats, utils, grDevices, graphics
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://example.com/mypackage
BugReports: https://example.com/mypackage/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
